DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n✩ 🪐Summer Astrology Reading Pop Up 
 ✩ 🪐\n\nCome see us at Haunt by Spoon and Hook Sundays 12-4pm all Augu
 st\nLearn about your soul's blueprint and/or how the current sky is influe
 ncing you.\n\n\\~First come first serve\, sign up station will be set up\\
 ~\n\nPop ups are the only way to access our 10 min for $10 special ✩\n\n
 * **30 min Mini Chart or Transit Reading $55**\n* **10 min for $10 Intuiti
 ve Musings**\n* **75 min Full Chart Reading $111**\n\n**-Visual References
  Emailed-**\n**-Recording Welcome-**\n[sensefulwellness@gmail.com](mailto:
 sensefulwellness@gmail.com) for any questions
